### Health
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### Recommend an upgrade
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "metrics": {
    "resource_id": "db-prod-1", "resource_type": "database",
    "current_version": "14.2", "target_version": "15.4",
    "criticality": "HIGH", "error_rate": 0.08, "cpu_p95": 85, "open_incidents": 1,
    "days_since_last_upgrade": 420,
    "hourly_usage": [
      {"hour": 0, "utilization": 20}, {"hour": 3, "utilization": 5},
      {"hour": 4, "utilization": 6}, {"hour": 12, "utilization": 90}
    ]
  },
  "explain_verbose": true
}

### List pending human reviews
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/recommendations/reviews/pending

### Approve / reject a recommendation
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/recommendations/<REC_ID>/review
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reviewer": "sre-oncall", "approved": true, "note": "canary plan looks good" }
